
---

### 📄 .gitignore

```gitignore
# Byte-compiled / optimized Python files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
venv/
env/
.venv/
ENV/

# IDE settings
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs and databases
*.log
*.sqlite3

# Environment variables
.env

# Uncomment the next line if you don't want to commit the text file
# analyz.txt